        "TileImage": "$($repository fddb2a2f-9710-4676-aa04-5acee82dbc5b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\rWe have tracked down the Syndicate leader: they are currently residing at the Ark Society. Your job is to eliminate them along with 4 key members of the Syndicate: 3 clients and 1 courier.\r\r-Finley Henry wants to elevate his food with &quot;special ingredients&quot;.\r-Muriel Mortensen has changed out Janus&apos; organs to lie on the autopsy test.\r-Murray L. Haas manages the stolen goods for the Ark Society, and has ordered organs for safekeeping for future surgeries.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
